4
00:00:12.507 --> 00:00:16.770
Today we learn about Nutrition for Performance. Let's go!

5
00:00:17.938 --> 00:00:22.938
Carbohydrates. Say it with me. Carbohydrates!

6
00:00:26.453 --> 00:00:30.119
