Hydration!

17
00:01:41.073 --> 00:01:46.213
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:46.263 --> 00:01:47.446
Supplements!

19
00:01:48.613 --> 00:01:53.970
Did you know? Most young athletes can meet their needs from food alone without supplements!

20
00:01:54.020 --> 00:01:56.077
